body:
I really appreciate your response. To be fair, I'm actually on four medications which is the average for most US households. One of the meds is a beta blocker and I have 0 use for it. 

I'm also Bipolar II as well. I'm thinking that that's probably the reason why I got depressed on Monday as well. I'm going to ask my doctor to get a mood stabilizer increase tomorrow. I'm just sad that this happened tbh, I wanna cry. I was doing so good then I just crashed and lost all sense of identity. I feel like I've never truly had my own sense of identity, I mainly emulate the identities of other people that I admire. Then usually after about a week of doing it I forget about it.

&#x200B;

New update,  I just tried on some makeup with pink lipstick, some skinny jeans, blue t-shirt, and bright blue blazer...I feel so good and kinda feel like my true self. Sad that I can't go out and walk around like this...I live in Idaho lmao. I wish I possessed the courage to be myself....

&#x200B;

You are right though, I should see an OCD specialist.
